# place.scen -- join AI-1 (the last table), ready, place the fleet.
wait 300
hold down 3
wait 20
hold down 3
wait 20
hold down 3
wait 20
hold down 3
wait 20
press fire
wait 150
snap lobby
press fire
until 39 1 900
wait 60
snap place0
xram 4D 8
hold right 3
wait 20
hold down 3
wait 20
snap moved
key R
wait 30
snap turned
xram 4D 8
press fire
wait 60
snap kept
xram 4D 8
key Z
wait 90
snap auto
xram 38 8
xram 4D 8
